  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出 $\\sqrt{16\\times49\\times4}$ 的值，利用关于非负因数的积的",
        "平方根的定理，得到：",
        "$\\sqrt{16\\times49\\times4}=\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{49}\\times\\sqrt{4}=4\\times7\\times2=56$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 求 $\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{169}}$ 的值.",
        "根据定理2，得：",
        "$\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{169}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{33}}{\\sqrt{169}}=\\frac{6}{13}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 把 $\\sqrt{49a^2}$（$a<0$）写成单项式.",
        "根据关于非负因数的积的平方根定理，",
        "$\\sqrt{49a^2}=\\sqrt{49}\\times\\sqrt{a^2}=7\\times|a|$.",
        "如果 $a<0$，那么 $|a|=-a$，于是，$\\sqrt{49a^2}=7\\times(-a)↵=-7a$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 求积 $\\sqrt{20}\\times\\sqrt{5}$ 的值.",
        "我们把等式 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\times\\sqrt{b}$（$a\\geq 0$，$b\\geq 0$）写成另一形",
        "式，就是：",
        "$\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}=\\sqrt{ab}$.",
        "得到：",
        "$\\sqrt{20}\\cdot\\sqrt{5}=\\sqrt{100}=10$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6. 求商 $\\frac{\\sqrt{80}}{\\sqrt{5}}$ 的值.",
        "我们把等式 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$（$a\\geq 0$，$b>0$）写成另一形式，就",
        "是：",
        "$\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
